title: Resolve a major reform vote

@resolve
title: Verify authority to carry the bill
go-to: authority_lost if left_in_government = 0 or government_has_confidence = 0 or caretaker_government = 1; count if left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0

@authority_lost
title: The mandate disappears before the count
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const issue = Q.reform_pressure_issue;
if (["abortion", "marriage", "labor"].includes(issue)) {
    Q[issue + "_reform_proposal_stage"] =
        Number(Q[issue + "_reform_goal_stage"]) || 4;
}
Q.reform_pressure_pending = 0;
Q.reform_pressure_mode = "None";
Q.reform_pressure_cooldown = 2;
Q.reform_pressure_due_time = -1;
Q.reform_pressure_return_mode = "card";
Q.reform_pressure_last_result =
    "The bill is deferred because Lewica no longer has governing authority";
Q.news_headline = Q.reform_pressure_last_result;
!}

The cabinet lost confidence, entered caretaker status or lost Lewica before
the delayed confrontation could be resolved. No law is enacted and no project
momentum is confiscated; the ambitious bill returns when governing authority
does.

- @poland_polling: Carry the deferred bill into the next month

@count
title: Count the coalition and the Palace
on-arrival: {!
const issue = Q.reform_pressure_issue;
const target = Math.max(
    1,
    Math.min(4, Math.round(Number(Q.reform_pressure_target_stage) || 1))
);
if (Q.reform_pressure_return_mode != "pressure") {
    Q.reform_pressure_forced = 0;
}
const hostilePresident = Q.pres_2025_hostile_president || [
    "Andrzej Duda", "Krzysztof Bosak", "Karol Nawrocki",
    "Sławomir Mentzen", "Grzegorz Braun"
].includes(Q.president_name);
const koInCabinet =
    Q.government_party == "ko" || Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet;
const pslInCabinet =
    Q.government_party == "psl" || Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet;
const p2050InCabinet =
    Q.government_party == "p2050" || Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet;
const thirdWayActor = pslInCabinet &&
    (!p2050InCabinet || Number(Q.psl_relation) <= Number(Q.p2050_relation))
    ? "psl"
    : "p2050";
const thirdWayRelation = Number(Q[thirdWayActor + "_relation"]);
const abortionPalaceCommitment =
    Q.abortion_palace_president == Q.president_name
        ? Number(Q.abortion_palace_commitment)
        : 0;
const marriagePalaceCommitment =
    Q.marriage_palace_president == Q.president_name
        ? Number(Q.marriage_palace_commitment)
        : 0;
const laborPalaceCommitment =
    Q.labor_palace_president == Q.president_name
        ? Number(Q.labor_palace_commitment)
        : 0;
let blocker = "";
let blockerName = "";

const leftHoldsPremiership =
    Q.government_party == "lewica" ||
    Q.prime_minister_party == "lewica";
const pisPalace = [
    "Andrzej Duda",
    "Karol Nawrocki",
    "Mateusz Morawiecki",
    "Beata Szydło",
    "Przemysław Czarnek"
].includes(Q.president_name);
const trzaskowskiPalace = Q.president_name == "Rafał Trzaskowski";
const veryFriendlyPresident = Number(Q.president_relation) >= 58;

let hardTierCap = 4;

// If Lewica does not hold the PM post, tier 4 cannot be tabled.
if (!leftHoldsPremiership) {
    hardTierCap = Math.min(hardTierCap, 3);
}

// Presidential profile hard-caps available settlement tiers.
if (pisPalace) {
    hardTierCap = Math.min(
        hardTierCap,
        issue == "labor" ? 3 : 2
    );
} else if (trzaskowskiPalace) {
    hardTierCap = Math.min(
        hardTierCap,
        issue == "labor" ? 2 : 3
    );
} else if (!veryFriendlyPresident) {
    hardTierCap = Math.min(hardTierCap, 2);
}

if (target > hardTierCap) {
    if (!leftHoldsPremiership && target >= 4) {
        blocker = Q.government_party;
        blockerName = "Prime Minister " + Q.prime_minister;
    } else {
        blocker = "president";
        blockerName = "President " + Q.president_name;
    }
}

if (!blocker && issue == "abortion") {
    if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
        const pisLimited =
            Number(Q.pis_relation) >= (target == 1 ? 30 : 52) ||
            Number(Q.abortion_pis_commitment) >= (target == 1 ? 1 : 2) ||
            Q.abortion_referendum_mandate;
        const pisMaximum =
            Number(Q.abortion_pis_commitment) >= target ||
            (
                Number(Q.pis_relation) >= (target == 3 ? 68 : 78) &&
                Number(Q.abortion_pis_commitment) >= target - 1 &&
                (
                    Q.abortion_referendum_mandate ||
                    Q.president_name == "Rafał Trzaskowski"
                )
            );
        if ((target <= 2 && !pisLimited) || (target >= 3 && !pisMaximum)) {
            blocker = "pis";
            blockerName = "PiS";
        }
    } else {
        const pisLimitedSupport =
            target <= 2 &&
            Number(Q.pis_relation) >= 55 &&
            Number(Q.abortion_pis_commitment) >= 2;
        if (
            koInCabinet &&
            target >= 3 &&
            Number(Q.ko_relation) < 45 &&
            Number(Q.abortion_ko_commitment) < 2
        ) {
            blocker = "ko";
            blockerName = "KO";
        } else if (
            (pslInCabinet || p2050InCabinet) &&
            target >= 2 &&
            thirdWayRelation < 48 + Math.max(0, target - 2) * 10 &&
            Number(Q.abortion_third_way_commitment) < target &&
            !Q.abortion_referendum_mandate &&
            !pisLimitedSupport
        ) {
            blocker = thirdWayActor;
            blockerName = "PSL / Third Way";
        } else if (
            koInCabinet &&
            target == 4 &&
            Number(Q.ko_classical_liberal_share) > 55 &&
            Number(Q.ko_relation) < 62 &&
            Number(Q.abortion_ko_commitment) < 3
        ) {
            blocker = "ko";
            blockerName = "KO's conservative-liberal wing";
        }
    }
    if (!blocker && hostilePresident) {
        const palaceFloor = Q.reform_pressure_palace_override ||
            abortionPalaceCommitment >= target || target == 1 ||
            (
                target == 2 &&
                (
                    Number(Q.president_relation) >= 35 ||
                    abortionPalaceCommitment >= 1 ||
                    Q.abortion_referendum_mandate
                )
            ) ||
            (
                target == 3 &&
                abortionPalaceCommitment >= 2 &&
                (
                    Number(Q.president_relation) >= 52 ||
                    Q.abortion_referendum_mandate
                )
            ) ||
            (
                target == 4 &&
                abortionPalaceCommitment >= 3 &&
                Number(Q.president_relation) >= 68 &&
                Q.abortion_referendum_mandate
            );
        if (!palaceFloor) {
            blocker = "president";
            blockerName = "President " + Q.president_name;
        }
    }
} else if (!blocker && issue == "marriage") {
    if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
        const pisLimited =
            Number(Q.pis_relation) >= (target == 1 ? 28 : 55) ||
            Number(Q.marriage_pis_commitment) >= (target == 1 ? 1 : 2);
        const pisMaximum =
            Number(Q.marriage_pis_commitment) >= target ||
            (
                Number(Q.pis_relation) >= (target == 3 ? 72 : 82) &&
                Number(Q.marriage_pis_commitment) >= target - 1 &&
                Q.marriage_referendum_mandate &&
                Q.president_name == "Rafał Trzaskowski"
            );
        if ((target <= 2 && !pisLimited) || (target >= 3 && !pisMaximum)) {
            blocker = "pis";
            blockerName = "PiS";
        }
    } else {
        const pisLimitedSupport =
            target <= 2 &&
            Number(Q.pis_relation) >= 55 &&
            Number(Q.marriage_pis_commitment) >= 2;
        if (
            koInCabinet &&
            target >= 3 &&
            Number(Q.ko_relation) < 45 &&
            Number(Q.marriage_ko_commitment) < 2
        ) {
            blocker = "ko";
            blockerName = "KO";
        } else if (
            (pslInCabinet || p2050InCabinet) &&
            target >= 2 &&
            thirdWayRelation < 52 + Math.max(0, target - 2) * 10 &&
            Number(Q.marriage_third_way_commitment) < target &&
            !Q.marriage_referendum_mandate &&
            !pisLimitedSupport
        ) {
            blocker = thirdWayActor;
            blockerName = "PSL / Third Way";
        } else if (
            koInCabinet &&
            target == 4 &&
            Number(Q.ko_classical_liberal_share) > 55 &&
            Number(Q.ko_relation) < 62 &&
            Number(Q.marriage_ko_commitment) < 3
        ) {
            blocker = "ko";
            blockerName = "KO's conservative-liberal wing";
        }
    }
    if (!blocker && hostilePresident) {
        const dudaLimited =
            Q.president_name == "Andrzej Duda" && target == 1;
        const palaceFloor = Q.reform_pressure_palace_override ||
            marriagePalaceCommitment >= target || dudaLimited ||
            (
                target == 2 &&
                (
                    Number(Q.president_relation) >= 38 ||
                    marriagePalaceCommitment >= 1
                )
            ) ||
            (
                target == 3 &&
                marriagePalaceCommitment >= 2 &&
                (
                    Number(Q.president_relation) >= 55 ||
                    Q.marriage_referendum_mandate
                )
            ) ||
            (
                target == 4 &&
                marriagePalaceCommitment >= 3 &&
                Number(Q.president_relation) >= 70 &&
                Q.marriage_referendum_mandate
            );
        if (!palaceFloor) {
            blocker = "president";
            blockerName = "President " + Q.president_name;
        }
    }
} else if (!blocker && issue == "labor") {
    if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
        const solidaristLead =
            Number(Q.pis_solidarist_share) >=
            Number(Q.pis_market_hardliner_share);
        const pisLimited =
            Number(Q.pis_relation) >= 25 ||
            Number(Q.labor_pis_commitment) >= target ||
            (solidaristLead && Number(Q.pis_relation) >= 15);
        const pisStrong =
            (
                Number(Q.pis_relation) >= 40 &&
                (Number(Q.labor_pis_commitment) >= 1 || solidaristLead)
            ) || Number(Q.labor_pis_commitment) >= target;
        const pisMaximum =
            (
                Number(Q.pis_relation) >= 50 &&
                Number(Q.labor_pis_commitment) >= 2 && solidaristLead
            ) || Number(Q.labor_pis_commitment) >= target;
        if (
            (target <= 2 && !pisLimited) ||
            (target == 3 && !pisStrong) ||
            (target == 4 && !pisMaximum)
        ) {
            blocker = "pis";
            blockerName = solidaristLead
                ? "PiS's hostile leadership"
                : "PiS's market wing";
        }
    } else {
        if (
            koInCabinet &&
            target >= 2 &&
            (
                Number(Q.ko_relation) < 40 ||
                Number(Q.ko_classical_liberal_share) >= 60
            ) &&
            Number(Q.labor_ko_commitment) < 2
        ) {
            blocker = "ko";
            blockerName = "KO's capitalist wing";
        } else if (
            (pslInCabinet || p2050InCabinet) &&
            target >= 3 &&
            thirdWayRelation < 45 + Math.max(0, target - 3) * 13 &&
            Number(Q.labor_third_way_commitment) < target
        ) {
            blocker = thirdWayActor;
            blockerName = "the Third Way's market wing";
        }
    }
    if (
        !blocker && hostilePresident && Q.government_party != "pis"
    ) {
        const palaceFloor = Q.reform_pressure_palace_override ||
            laborPalaceCommitment >= target || target == 1 ||
            (
                target == 2 &&
                (
                    Number(Q.president_relation) >= 30 ||
                    laborPalaceCommitment >= 1
                )
            ) ||
            (
                target == 3 &&
                laborPalaceCommitment >= 2 &&
                Number(Q.president_relation) >= 48
            ) ||
            (
                target == 4 &&
                laborPalaceCommitment >= 3 &&
                Number(Q.president_relation) >= 62
            );
        if (!palaceFloor) {
            blocker = "president";
            blockerName = "President " + Q.president_name;
        }
    }
}

const reformNames = {
    abortion: "reproductive-rights reform",
    marriage: "legal recognition and equal marriage",
    labor: "labour-law reconstruction"
};
const settlementLabels = {
    abortion: [
        "No settlement", "emergency and clinician decriminalisation",
        "a limited decriminalisation compromise", "legal access through twelve weeks",
        "Canadian-model decriminalisation"
    ],
    marriage: [
        "No settlement", "a closest-person agreement",
        "registered cohabitation", "civil partnerships",
        "marriage equality and adoption"
    ],
    labor: [
        "No settlement", "funded inspection and token enforcement",
        "PIP reclassification and enforcement powers",
        "contract and labour-law protections", "the full Razem labour package"
    ]
};
Q.reform_pressure_issue_name = reformNames[issue];
if (blocker) {
    Q[issue + "_reform_proposal_stage"] = target;
    Q.reform_pressure_pending = 1;
    Q.reform_pressure_mode = "partner_objection";
    Q.reform_pressure_actor = blocker;
    Q.reform_pressure_actor_name = blockerName;
    Q.reform_pressure_intensity = Math.min(
        100,
        32 + target * 12 +
        (blocker == "president" ? 8 : 0) +
        (Q.hard_mode ? 8 : 0)
    );
    Q.reform_pressure_illegality = 0;
    Q.reform_pressure_due_time = Number(Q.time) || 0;
    Q.reform_pressure_objections += 1;
    Q.news_headline = blockerName + " opposes Lewica's " +
        reformNames[issue];
} else {
    const previous = Number(Q[issue + "_reform_stage"]) || 0;
    const forced = Q.reform_pressure_forced ? 1 : 0;
    Q[issue + "_reform_stage"] = target;
    Q[issue + "_reform_proposal_stage"] = target;
    Q[issue + "_reform_defined"] = 1;
    Q[issue + "_reform_settled"] = 1;
    Q[issue + "_reform_progress"] = Math.max(
        Number(Q[issue + "_reform_progress"]) || 0,
        target * 20
    );
    const deliveryByStage = [0, -2, 2, 4, 8];
    const trustByStage = [0, -2, 1, 2, 5];
    const credibilityByStage = [0, -4, 4, 8, 16];
    const audienceByStage = [0, -3, 3, 6, 12];
    const pollByStage = [0, -0.8, 0.6, 1.2, 3.0];
    const forcedPollBonus = [0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.9, 1.5];
    const rivalPenaltyByStage = [0, -0.15, 0.10, 0.25, 0.55];
    const forcedRivalPenalty = [0, 0.05, 0.10, 0.15, 0.20];
    const opinionByStage = [0, -3, 2, 4, 7];
    const forcedOpinionBonus = [0, 0, 1, 2, 4];
    const ownershipByStage = [0, -4, 2, 5, 9];
    const blocBoostByStage = [0, 0, 0.5, 1, 2];
    const forcedBlocBonus = [0, 0, 0, 0.5, 1];
    const voterBlocs = [
        "metropolitan_liberals", "liberal_professionals",
        "public_service_families", "industrial_logistics",
        "provincial_welfare", "rural_localists",
        "older_welfare_households", "anti_establishment_youth"
    ];
    const opinionKeys = {
        abortion: "abortion_rights",
        marriage: "lgbt_equality",
        labor: "social_spending"
    };
    const clampOpinion = function(key, change) {
        Q[key] = Math.max(
            0,
            Math.min(100, (Number(Q[key]) || 0) + change)
        );
    };
    const pollSwing = pollByStage[target] +
        (forced ? forcedPollBonus[target] : 0);
    const rivalPenalty = rivalPenaltyByStage[target] +
        (forced ? forcedRivalPenalty[target] : 0);
    const opinionShift = opinionByStage[target] +
        (forced ? forcedOpinionBonus[target] : 0);
    const broadBlocBoost = blocBoostByStage[target] +
        (forced ? forcedBlocBonus[target] : 0);
    const opinionKey = opinionKeys[issue];
    Q.government_delivery += deliveryByStage[target];
    Q.public_trust += trustByStage[target] +
        (forced && target >= 3 ? target - 2 : 0);
    Q.left_poll += pollSwing;
    for (const rival of ["pis", "ko", "psl", "p2050", "konf"]) {
        Q[rival + "_poll"] = Math.max(
            0,
            (Number(Q[rival + "_poll"]) || 0) - rivalPenalty
        );
    }
    for (const bloc of voterBlocs) {
        const affinityKey = bloc + "_left_affinity";
        Q[affinityKey] = (Number(Q[affinityKey]) || 0) + broadBlocBoost;
    }
    clampOpinion(opinionKey + "_support", opinionShift);
    clampOpinion(opinionKey + "_backlash", -opinionShift);
    clampOpinion(
        opinionKey + "_left_ownership",
        ownershipByStage[target] + (forced ? target + 1 : 0)
    );
    clampOpinion(
        opinionKey + "_salience",
        (target == 1 ? 2 : target) + (forced ? target : 0)
    );
    if (issue == "abortion") {
        Q.feminist_trust += credibilityByStage[target];
        Q.progressive_credibility += credibilityByStage[target] / 2;
        Q.government_goal_equality = 1;
        if (target >= 1) Q.abortion_law_enacted = 1;
    } else if (issue == "marriage") {
        Q.progressive_credibility += credibilityByStage[target];
        Q.minority_safety += audienceByStage[target];
        Q.government_goal_equality = 1;
    } else {
        Q.labor_credibility += credibilityByStage[target];
        Q.workers_support += audienceByStage[target];
        Q.government_goal_labor = 1;
    }
    Q.last_policy_stage = "Enacted settlement: " +
        settlementLabels[issue][target];
    Q.last_policy_authority = Q.reform_pressure_palace_override
        ? "Three-fifths Sejm veto override"
        : forced
            ? "Lewica-forced coalition vote and President " + Q.president_name
            : "Sejm majority and President " + Q.president_name;
    Q.last_policy_implementation = 1;
    Q.news_headline = reformNames[issue] +
        (forced ? " survives coalition opposition with " : " closes with ") +
        settlementLabels[issue][target];
    Q.reform_pressure_forced = 0;
}
!}
go-to: poland_reform_pressure if reform_pressure_return_mode = "pressure" and reform_pressure_pending = 1; pressure_enacted if reform_pressure_return_mode = "pressure" and reform_pressure_pending = 0; objection_queued if reform_pressure_return_mode != "pressure" and reform_pressure_pending = 1; enacted if reform_pressure_return_mode != "pressure" and reform_pressure_pending = 0

@enacted
title: The reform enters the statute book
new-page: true

**[+ news_headline +].** This is the final settlement of the campaign. A
compromise law is not the first rung of a later automatic climb; accepting and
enacting it closes the chapter at that outcome.

- #poland_card_finish

@objection_queued
title: A partner withholds its votes
new-page: true

**[+ reform_pressure_actor_name +] opposes the bill.** The text is ready and
the numerical passage threshold was met, but a bad relationship or an
unsettled red line has turned the vote into a coalition-survival question.

The confrontation will arrive when the month closes. Lewica may narrow the
bill, spend organisational resources, cash in a relationship or force the
issue and put the coalition under threat.

- #poland_card_finish

@pressure_enacted
title: The coalition and Palace count closes
new-page: true
on-arrival: reform_pressure_last_result = news_headline; reform_pressure_return_mode = "card"; reform_pressure_palace_override = 0

The remaining veto players have been counted in sequence. **[+
news_headline +].** The enacted settlement closes this project, whether it
preserved the original ambitious bill or survived only after being forced
down.

- @poland_polling: Carry the enacted settlement into the new month
